# Context of the images built from the repository root: the API
# (src/Llm.Api/Dockerfile), code-intel (src/CodeIntel/Dockerfile) and the web
# (src/web/Dockerfile, which builds docs/ into its manual). They build from
# source; nothing prebuilt, secret or large crosses into the context.
.git
.github
.claude
.remember
.config

# Not needed by any image. deploy/ holds .env, backups and the models.
deploy/
# Code Studio's workspaces image (deploy/services/workspaces/Dockerfile) takes its supervisor from there.
!deploy/services/workspaces/supervisor.py
# Code Arena embeds the sandbox's arena module (code mode).
!deploy/services/sandbox/arena/__init__.py
# The app embeds the list of the stack's features and of the installation's settings, and the 3D tool's scripts (scripts/blender-check.py runs them too).
!deploy/features
!deploy/settings
!deploy/services/blender/tool/
docs/measurements/
evals/
clients/
tools/*
!tools/fetch-sqlite-vec.sh
!tools/publish-code-arena.sh
!tools/offline-nuget
!tools/ide-launcher
# src/web stays for Code Arena's web interface (the API's code-arena-web stage), without what is built or downloaded.
src/web/dist/
src/web/test-results/
src/web/playwright-report/
src/web/e2e/.auth/
# Built in the image from src/web: never a local build.
src/CodeArena/web/
tests/Llm.Tests/
tests/deploy/

**/bin/
**/obj/
dist/
native/
# sqlite-vec as tools/fetch-sqlite-vec.sh fetched and checked it (code-intel takes it in; the script checks it again).
!native/runtimes/
**/node_modules/
src/code-intel-web/dist/
src/code-intel-web/test-results/
src/code-intel-web/playwright-report/
src/code-intel-web/e2e/.work/
TestResults/

data/
packs/
.packwork/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
